  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Introduce console command & config system:\n      - Add a centralized console command subsystem and .env-based config loader.\n      - ConsoleCommandAttribute now allows multiple usages (aliases).\n      - New LuciferCMD class scans assemblies for ConsoleCommand methods, maps aliases, provides a runtime command loop, supports OS shell execution via /cmd, and adds /clear and /cls aliases.\n      - New LuciferConfig loads environment variables from .env (root or assets/config) and populates static properties annotated with ConfigAttribute.\n      - Lucifer static initializer now forces LuciferConfig and LuciferCMD class constructors and exposes CMD(ReadOnlySpan<char/byte>) helpers.\n      - Host and Lucifer classes were cleaned up: duplicated command dispatcher and config-loading logic removed from LuciferHost, and server/manager/service/host control methods were annotated with ConsoleCommand attributes.",
